套诊断标准准不准，找了 291 名丧亲者，在丧亲后 0–6、6–12、12–24 个月分三次访谈。诊断的核心表现是对逝者的强烈想念。还要加上这九项里的至少五项。前五项是情感麻木、震惊、觉得生活没有意义、不信任他人、因这次失去而痛苦。后四项是难以接受、认不清自己该是谁、回避现实、无法继续生活。这些表现要每天都出现，或者严重到干不了事。而且在亲人去世至少 6 个月后仍然存在，还影响着日常生活。还有一项 95 人抽签分两组的试验，做 16 次治疗、平均 19 周。针对复杂哀伤的治疗有效率 51%。普通的人际心理治疗 28%（P=0.02，差别不太可能是碰巧）。前者起效也更快。需治疗人数 4.3，即平均每治 4.3 个人就多一个好转"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Lundorff M, et al. (2017). Prevalence of prolonged grief disorder in adult bereavement: A systematic review and meta-analysis. Journal of Affective Disorders. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jad.2017.01.030","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jad.2017.01.030"]},"；Prigerson HG, et al. (2009). Prolonged grief disorder: Psychometric validation of criteria proposed for DSM-V and ICD-11. PLoS Medicine. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pmed.1000121","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pmed.1000121"]},"；Shear MK, et al. (2005). Treatment of complicated grief: a randomized controlled trial. JAMA. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.293.21.2601","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.293.21.2601"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["别自己卡月份。真正的判断是「影响到吃饭、睡觉、上班、带孩子」，对上了就去挂号。科室叫精神科、心理科或临床心理科，公立精神专科医院都有。这个诊断在不同资料里叫复杂哀伤，也叫延长哀伤障碍。不同标准要求持续多久也不一样，有的写 6 个月，有的写 12 个月。9.8% 这个比例来自 14 项做法差异不小的研究，作者也提醒它未必能照搬到别的人群身上。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/29-07"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"家长去世后，如实告诉孩子、让他参加告别、别送去别处「换个环境」"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/29-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"别一上来就花钱做哀伤咨询，先看自己的哀伤是不是真的卡住了（第 8 条那几条症状）"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/29-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["亲人死于自杀、意外或凶案的，别指望硬扛，主动去找专业帮助"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["配偶死于自杀的人，五年内被查出精神障碍的概率比一般人高约八成（男性）、七成（女性）。和配偶死于其他原因的人比，也高七成到一倍。这类丧亲的人更容易觉得被人疏远、觉…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/29-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["丧偶后的头半年，把三餐、睡觉、慢性病的药和复查交给一个固定的人盯着"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["丧偶后不到半年，同期死亡的概率比没丧偶的人高约四成。半年以后降到高约一成半。男性高约两成三，女性